<title>RUSSIA: Russian Aug unemployment little changed at 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Aug unemployment little changed at 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia fell to 6.68 million or 9.2 percent of the workforce at the end of August from 6.73 million in July, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	AUG 96     JUL 96     AUG 95</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)     6.68	 6.73	 6.22</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce     9.2	  N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (million) 2.55	 2.56	 2.10</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
